Alikraken's Blog in Brainfuck

The whole Jekyll site as one program  the default and page and post layouts with their
includes  the index and archive and about and 404 pages  the four writeups  the atom feed
and the sitemap

Input   the current year as four digits  for the footer and the archive heading
Output  every file of the site  each starts with byte 28  its path and a newline

The main loop makes one pass per page or per post of a listing  index  archive  about  404
the posts  feed items  sitemap urls  so each layout and each post body exists only once
The index excerpt is the body cut after its first paragraph  and the feed prints the same
body xml escaped  by shifting the pointer onto a twin bank whose dictionary spells every
tag and special character escaped while its text registers stay identical

tape  year input  date workspace  one hot state  flags of this pass  rendered date
      page and post flags  then the bank
bank  escape switch and marker  full post flag  text registers  dictionary of tags

read the current year
,>,>,>,

set up the text registers and the dictionary in the bank and in its escaped twin
